WEBVTT

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:29.930
"Lian Tong Temple"

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:48.620
Kanyo!

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.560
Hang in there, Kanyo!

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.260
T-Taito...

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:55.900
What on earth happened?!
How many of them are there?!

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.100
O-One...

00:00:57.100 --> 00:00:58.530
One?!

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:28.130
The Xian Jia Lan Wu...

00:01:28.130 --> 00:01:32.590
At last, the sword of the ruler
of the world is mine...

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.910
Damn you...

00:01:39.910 --> 00:01:43.740
Just what the hell do you think you're doing
while others are trying to enjoy the night?!

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:48.910
You piece of scum! You'll pay for this!

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:51.950
What?!

00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:54.790
Those who stand in the way shall be cut down.

00:01:58.330 --> 00:01:59.660
Not bad.

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:02.000
I can see how you managed
to storm this place all by yourself!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.830
My objective is the conqueror's
sword, the Xian Jia Lan Wu.

00:02:05.830 --> 00:02:09.270
It is only proper that I obtain it on my own.

00:02:09.270 --> 00:02:10.970
Enough of your nonsense!

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:15.170
I won't even let you have a single rock!

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:23.350
Don't underestimate me!

00:02:33.860 --> 00:02:37.490
You made me use my right arm. Impressive.

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.840
Damn...

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.530
Don't touch the sword!

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:55.580
D-damn you!

00:02:55.580 --> 00:02:57.550
I will overlook your insolence.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:02:59.820
Now leave the Xian Jia Lan Wu and begone.

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:02.320
Like hell I will! Now I'm <i>really</i> mad!

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:05.860
You're going down now! I swear it!

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:10.100
Fool. That is the sword of the chosen conqueror.

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:12.200
A measly insect cannot possibly draw it.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.430
Shut up!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:22.040
Th-that's...!

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:33.960
What is this sword?!

00:03:33.960 --> 00:03:37.760
What?! You've chosen the Alkaid,
Xian Jia Lan Wu?!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.890
No! That's not possible!

00:03:42.060 --> 00:03:45.070
My meeting the Alkaid here
was also destined by the stars!

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.770
Alkaid? What the hell are you talking about?!

00:03:47.770 --> 00:03:50.270
You shall fall before my cause!

00:03:50.270 --> 00:03:52.260
The hell with that, mustache freak!

00:04:08.390 --> 00:04:13.450
What was that shock wave just now?!
Was that bastard holding back before?!

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.670
Die!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.420
Although the Alkaid, you are but a boy.

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.090
Your unsheathing of the sword poses little--

00:04:37.090 --> 00:04:38.180
What?!

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:46.290
I-I'm not finished yet...
Not until I avenge my friends...!

00:04:52.930 --> 00:04:56.130
Boy... You still intend to beleaguer me?!

00:05:51.230 --> 00:05:53.520
Fall, Alkaid!

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:09.210
Lord Keiro! Welcome back!

00:06:12.210 --> 00:06:14.880
Oh! Look, men!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:19.910
At long last, the Xian Jia Lan Wu
is in our Lord Keiro's possession!

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:31.510
In the heavens are seven stars.
They are the stars of the Big Dipper.

00:06:31.510 --> 00:06:32.910
The seven stars:

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:36.180
In other words, the heroes
who are the Dipper Bearers;

00:06:36.180 --> 00:06:38.350
the karma in place since Creation;

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.980
the transmigration of the wild gods;

00:06:39.980 --> 00:06:42.150
the tales of warriors.

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:45.350
And, just as in this world
there are yin and yang,

00:06:45.350 --> 00:06:49.260
so too are there the opposite poles
of Dubhe and Alkaid in the Big Dipper.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:54.190
These two are "wild stars" that hold
complete sway over the land.

00:07:18.190 --> 00:07:19.790
Found some!

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.880
Hang in there, Taito!

00:07:31.530 --> 00:07:33.740
Master Sonnei. Senior Soei.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:34.900
Be at ease.

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:38.340
We've been so busy with
the funerals the past few days

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.080
that we haven't had time to see you.

00:07:40.080 --> 00:07:43.980
I thank you again in my son's place, Ryuko.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.820
No, it was only dumb luck
that I happened upon him.

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:50.650
It seems my terrible sense of
direction <i>can</i> be useful.

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:53.560
No, it was in both of your destinies.

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.690
You mean the karma of the stars?

00:07:55.690 --> 00:07:59.330
They say fools are tough,
but it's a relief that he's all right

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:02.060
and that we didn't
have to give him a funeral.

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:06.430
Please forgive me. If only I had
arrived a little sooner...

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:07.370
Don't say that.

00:08:07.370 --> 00:08:11.170
Had I not gone to Emei Shan
for moon viewing that night...

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.780
It was I who invited you to that moon viewing.

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:18.350
Still, it's unbelievable to think that someone
single-handedly managed to take on

00:08:18.350 --> 00:08:22.120
the renowned warriors of the Qing Long Platoon
<i>and</i> the armed priests of Lian Tong Temple...

00:08:22.120 --> 00:08:24.750
Not even the Alkaid was a match for him...

00:08:24.750 --> 00:08:27.620
What did you just say, Master Sonnei?

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:32.060
Taito! Taito!

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:33.400
Taito!

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.130
Hello, Master Sonnei!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.370
You're always in such high spirits, Laila.

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:42.060
Not at all. My dumb brother
makes me cry every day.

00:08:44.740 --> 00:08:46.040
Is he still not...?

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:48.810
He'll be fine now.
His wounds have nearly healed.

00:08:48.810 --> 00:08:51.250
Really?! In that case...

00:08:51.250 --> 00:08:54.150
...get up already!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.150
Good morning, dumb brother!

00:08:58.150 --> 00:09:01.460
What the hell, Laila?! What's the big idea?!
What's the big idea?!

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.060
Why did you say that twice?

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.090
Shut up! I'm gonna hit you for that!

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:08.400
My dumb brother's mad now!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:10.900
You can't get away from me! Get back here!

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:12.630
Who is she?

00:09:12.630 --> 00:09:16.330
Taito's younger sister. My daughter.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:21.670
Stop, Laila! Get back here!

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:25.510
Sorry! Forgive me!

00:09:28.420 --> 00:09:32.250
Wh-what? What are you looking at?

00:10:00.020 --> 00:10:01.710
Kanyo's sword...

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:07.720
In my eyes, Lian Tong Temple
was my home; Tai Shan my garden.

00:10:07.720 --> 00:10:13.460
And the priests and the Qing Long Platoon
members were my irreplaceable friends.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.190
And now they're all...

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:19.130
--Damn it!
--Taito!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:25.040
Taito! Stop it!

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:35.650
Taito! That's not cool at all!
Lashing out like that is pathetic!

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:36.750
What?!

00:10:36.750 --> 00:10:40.390
You're completely wrong if you think
you're the only one who's sad!

00:10:40.390 --> 00:10:42.760
We're the lucky ones.

00:10:42.760 --> 00:10:46.760
Those people can't even
feel sadness anymore!

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:49.030
I'm glad you didn't die.

00:10:49.030 --> 00:10:52.230
Just being able to feel that makes me happy.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:57.660
Laila. I'm strong, aren't I?

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:02.740
Then why did I lose?!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:06.740
H-how... How should I know?!

00:11:09.680 --> 00:11:11.580
Medicinal herbs...

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.890
Men don't care how other people feel at all!

00:11:18.890 --> 00:11:21.230
They're so hopeless!

00:11:21.230 --> 00:11:24.720
Stupid Taito!

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:43.150
Why am I unable to draw it?

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:50.130
Is that Alkaid boy still alive?

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:56.000
Very well. If you will not choose me,
then I will take the land by force.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.930
Come, Shimei.

00:12:00.240 --> 00:12:05.670
Impressive, Lord Keiro, that you can
even detect the presence of a dead person.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:06.640
Go.

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:09.840
Leave the Alkaid's destruction to me.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:19.650
Absolutely no one shall stand
in my way to domination!

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:22.660
The Xian Jia Lan Wu?!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:26.660
That's the symbol of the
emperor of our Xian Empire!

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:29.430
Indeed, it is the sword of conquerors.

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.670
He who draws the Xian Jia
Lan Wu will rule the world.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:35.540
Shouldn't it be in the
emperor's possession then?

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:40.840
A false one is. The real one was
kept here at the Lian Tong Temple.

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.710
Why is that?

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.850
Because the current emperor couldn't draw it.

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:47.880
He couldn't?!

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:52.390
Being unable to unsheathe the sword of rulers
would place his position as emperor at risk.

00:12:52.390 --> 00:12:56.380
So he secretly left it in our hands.

00:12:57.960 --> 00:13:01.660
Just how many lives were lost
for one measly sword?!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:05.900
Then the bandit's intent
was to steal the Xian Jia Lan Wu...

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.800
Just who was he?

00:13:07.800 --> 00:13:10.740
Someone saw troops in the mountains.

00:13:10.740 --> 00:13:14.410
They carried black flags that said
"Wolf" and red flags that said "Xian"...

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:17.150
That can't be! Red "Xian"
flags are carried by...!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:20.520
Yes. The main imperial army.

00:13:20.520 --> 00:13:25.250
Such foolishness. Stealing the sword
won't amount to anything.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.720
Huh?

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:30.390
It chooses its own master.

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:34.360
The fact is that the current emperor
wasn't chosen by the sword.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:38.560
The sword's master has already been decided.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:02.550
He'll pay for this. That
mustached bastard will pay...

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:08.860
I understand how he feels. But...

00:14:11.430 --> 00:14:12.760
Okay!

00:14:15.640 --> 00:14:17.570
Hey! Taito!

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:24.550
That was dangerous!

00:14:24.550 --> 00:14:27.450
What's the big idea, Laila?!
What's the big idea, Laila?!

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:28.880
Why did you say that twice?

00:14:28.880 --> 00:14:32.420
Shut up! It's a habit of mine!

00:14:32.420 --> 00:14:37.430
Hey, Taito. I know you feel angry,
but I don't want to see you like this!

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:39.660
Wh-what brought that on?

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:44.660
It's not like you! You need to always
be cheerful and in high spirits!

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:51.930
Laila. Thanks for the herbs.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:56.910
Now if only there was
a medicine for curing stupidity.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.950
Stupidity causes other people so much trouble!

00:14:58.950 --> 00:15:00.580
Quit calling me stupid.

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:03.350
Even if we're not related by blood,
I still am your older brother.

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:06.750
Thank goodness that we aren't related by blood!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:09.350
Hey! Are you insulting me?!

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:30.510
Whoops, that was close.
Looks like he has some skill.

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:35.620
But not nearly enough.
The Alkaid is no trifling thing like that.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.520
Isn't that right?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.190
Guess I'll lay a trap.

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:58.840
It looks like it's going to rain.
Just after I did the laundry, too...

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:02.410
--Hello, young lady.
--Who's there?!

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:07.020
My boss left me with an errand to take care of.

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:10.350
Can't say I care myself, though.

00:16:10.350 --> 00:16:11.750
What business do you have with me?!

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:15.520
I only want to see what the Alkaid's
capable of when he's serious.

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:16.690
The Alkaid?!

00:16:16.690 --> 00:16:19.230
If he disappoints me,
I'll exterminate him.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:21.700
That's it, basically.

00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.100
That was Laila!

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:30.040
Laila!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.840
Laila! What happened?!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.880
Did something happen, Laila?

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:42.950
S-stay away... Taito...

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:44.510
What? I can't h--

00:16:48.760 --> 00:16:49.920
L-Laila?

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:53.130
N-no... M-my body's moving on its own...

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:56.960
You show yourself, Alkaid.

00:16:56.960 --> 00:16:59.530
The girl is my marionette.

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:00.770
What?!

00:17:00.770 --> 00:17:05.940
Now, then. Let's see the power of the Alkaid.

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:09.140
"Alkaid"? What the hell is that, anyway?!

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:11.380
What? You don't know?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:13.480
S-stop this!

00:17:13.480 --> 00:17:16.320
"Everyone knows but he himself," huh...

00:17:16.320 --> 00:17:19.790
Alkaid is a conqueror's star;
a sinful star that cuts down all

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:23.590
with its tremendous power
and guides the world to turmoil.

00:17:23.590 --> 00:17:24.830
What?!

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:27.760
You were born bearing Alkaid's karma.

00:17:27.760 --> 00:17:31.000
You have a pattern on your body, right?

00:17:31.000 --> 00:17:35.000
And there's another star that Alkaid
clashes with for domination: Dubhe.

00:17:35.000 --> 00:17:37.510
My boss Keiro, in other words.

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:41.640
Damn you! Don't tell me you're that
mustached bastard's henchman?!

00:17:44.810 --> 00:17:46.470
M-my body!

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:50.790
Easy! All too easy, Alkaid!

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:54.780
I thought you were lacking
somewhat, but not <i>this</i> much!

00:17:57.660 --> 00:17:58.990
Taito!

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:05.970
I'll tell you what you lack.

00:18:05.970 --> 00:18:11.110
Ambition, resolve, authority,
knowledge, skepticism...

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:12.600
...and hate!

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:17.280
What are you doing, you pervert?!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:22.050
You're one strong-willed cutie-pie!
You might just be my type!

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:25.450
D-damn you! Get away from Laila!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.290
There are some people out there

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:38.030
who get angrier from their
friends' pain than their own.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.520
Is this where the heart is?

00:18:42.700 --> 00:18:45.540
Stop it, damn you! Stop it!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:48.410
Sure, I'll stop. Instead...

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:52.650
Laila!

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:53.680
What did you do?!

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.080
She's going to strangle herself

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:58.750
and rip her flesh and shatter
her bones in doing so...

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.740
This will be a real sight!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:06.930
That's a good look. Just how I like it!

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:09.760
Damn you! I swear I'll get you for this!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:15.040
How empty that sounds!
What can you possibly do now?

00:19:15.040 --> 00:19:17.270
Taito...

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:19.010
You're powerless.

00:19:19.010 --> 00:19:22.080
That's right. You're powerless!

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.080
Just as you couldn't save your friends,

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:28.070
so too will you watch
your own dear sister die!

00:19:43.530 --> 00:19:44.530
This is...!

00:19:44.530 --> 00:19:47.870
What is this menacing energy?!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:50.900
Taito...

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:58.280
See, you <i>do</i> have it in ya.

00:20:00.310 --> 00:20:05.750
That's it. That's the hate you were lacking!

00:20:07.120 --> 00:20:12.490
How many centuries has it been since
the stars of Alkaid and Dubhe have appeared?

00:20:12.490 --> 00:20:14.430
This is exciting!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:25.310
<i>The star awakes and takes action!</i>

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:28.280
<i>Sir Taito appears to be reacting to my star!</i>

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:32.480
<i>My father always said he didn't</i>
<i>want Taito to awaken</i>.

00:20:32.480 --> 00:20:36.250
<i>He wanted him to live</i>
<i>peacefully as a normal person</i>.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.120
<i>You'll destroy yourself, Sir Taito!</i>

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:41.290
<i>Is the party finally starting?</i>

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:44.930
<i>Those harboring the stars meet,</i>
<i>their destinies intertwining</i>.

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:48.370
<i>On Hero Tales, "Chapter Two:</i>
<i>The Karma of Mizar."</i>

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.550
<i>My star is resonating!</i>
